+    // Each press is held for a 2-VBlank window so exactly one alternate-frame handler read sees a
+    // clean edge. NOTE (traced this session): the start-present flag 0x06098688 is NOT set by any
+    // panel consumer -- it is set by a player-character actor FSM (cart 0x2229cac / runtime
+    // 0x0602DCAC: 0x06098688[entity[0x34]-1]=1), which only runs once a player actor is spawned. So
+    // a panel START cannot raise it without the round's actor-spawn path (the STV_STARTFLAG diag
+    // forces it directly as a stand-in). See notes/port/stv_panel_input_status.md.
+    for (StvEvent& e : g_stv_events) {
